## Summary
A scalper was arrested for selling idol concert tickets at 13 times their original price and profiting 400 million won. The article highlights the illegal practice of ticket scalping in the entertainment industry.

## Key Points
- Scalping of tickets for idol concerts is an illegal activity.
- Tickets were resold at 13 times their face value.
- The scalper made a financial gain of 400 million won.
- The scalper has been arrested and detained.


